	(text "Digital isolator with integrated DC/DC\nIn: 3.3VDC (VDD = VIO)\nOut: 3.3VDC, 60mA, 24mVpp ripple\nCh: 1 forward + 1 reverse, 100Mbps\n    Fail-safe output HIGH (no F suffix)\nEff: 46% @ max load\nIso: Reinforced per VDE 0884-17, 5kVrms/60s\n     1000Vrms working, >8mm creepage/clearance\n     CTI >600V, material group I\nProtection: Soft-start, UVLO, OVP\n            Overload, short-circuit, thermal shutdown\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 86.614 0)
		(effects
